#N canvas 200 120 700 300 12;
#X text 20 10 fs_smooth <up> <down> - asymmetric one-pole smoother \, applied per incoming value: moves <up> of the way toward a rising input and <down> of the way toward a falling one (0..1 each). Fast attack + slow release (e.g. 0.5 0.06 at ~45 Hz: ~50 ms up \, ~0.4 s ring-out). Only advances when values arrive., f 85;
#X obj 20 110 inlet;
#X obj 20 150 expr if($f1 > $f2 \, $f2 + \$1 * ($f1 - $f2) \, $f2 + \$2 * ($f1 - $f2));
#X obj 20 190 t f f;
#X obj 20 230 outlet;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 0 3 0;
#X connect 3 1 2 1;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
